<title>USA: Millipore Corp names Lunger as new CFO.</title>
<headline>Millipore Corp names Lunger as new CFO.</headline>
<dateline>BEDFORD, Mass. 1997-06-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Millipore Corp said on Monday that it hap appointed Francis Lunger as corporate vice president and chief financial officer to succeed Michael Carroll, who was appointed president of Millipore Asia Ltd.</p>
<p>Lunger joins Millipore from Oak Industries Inc, a developer of components to the telecommunications industry, where he served as senior vice president and chief financial officer.</p>
<p>Millipore Corp produces separation technolgy used in analyzing and purifying fluids.</p>
</text>
